# CODEOWNERS — auto-request reviewer on every PR.
#
# Pairs with branch-protection rule `required_pull_request_reviews.require_code_owner_reviews = true`
# (configured by Phase 10 Full Treatment). Without CODEOWNERS, the required-review
# gate would be self-satisfied by the publisher — defeating the gate.
#
# Order matters: later patterns override earlier ones.

# Default owner — anything not otherwise matched.
*  @mcp-tool-shop

# Security-sensitive surfaces — explicit ownership.
/.github/workflows/  @mcp-tool-shop
/.github/dependabot.yml  @mcp-tool-shop
/Dockerfile  @mcp-tool-shop
/fly.toml  @mcp-tool-shop
/render.yaml  @mcp-tool-shop
/SECURITY.md  @mcp-tool-shop
/SHIP_GATE.md  @mcp-tool-shop
